      "settlementKey": "jormaelis:Utch’myrith",
      "description": "Rook MacReady is a dry, guarded Minotaur scout with a practiced mercenary’s eye, a parent’s desperation, and a code of restraint he clings to harder than he admits. As an Anubaldir-shaped Minotaur, he carries endurance, instinctual navigation, stubborn honor, and relentless pursuit in his bones, making him ideal for long-range scouting, caravan overwatch, and finding safe routes through bad country.\nHe works contracts through the Caravan Contract Desk in Utch’myrith, taking dangerous jobs across Jor’maelis so he can send coin home to the sibling caring for his sick child. Rook is sarcastic, careful with violence, and ashamed of some past contracts, but every shot he takes now is measured against one question: whether it gets him closer to a cure without turning him back into the kind of hired killer his child should never have to know.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Utch’myrith is a City in Jor’maelis, under Communalism, with moderate danger, Beach and grass with water, Farming, Partial forest terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin. Minotoar does not have a close ancestry entry in the open roster index, so table behavior should follow the local settlement record.",
